{"id":"38a14eb96d8a6dd5","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-refutation.md","title":"GL Refutation","display":"df-gl-refutation — GL Refutation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-refutation","aliases":["89-df-gl-refutation"],"display":"df-gl-refutation — GL Refutation","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-countermodel]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-refutation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-refutation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-refutation — GL Refutation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ece6738da9dd31ad\" href=\"?note=ece6738da9dd31ad\" title=\"89-df-gl-countermodel\">89-df-gl-countermodel</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}\\)</span> is the countermodel predicate from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ece6738da9dd31ad\" href=\"?note=ece6738da9dd31ad\" title=\"89-df-gl-countermodel\">89-df-gl-countermodel</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ref}_{G\\!L}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ref}_{G\\!L}(A)\\)</span> 是下述定义的一元语义反驳谓词，参数为模态公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}refutation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ref}_{G\\!L}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\;\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}(M,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}refutation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ref}_{G\\!L}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\;\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}(M,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL反驳证明公式不是定理</li>\n<li>GL反驳通过反模型实现</li>\n<li>GL反驳是 GL 完全性的关键</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"ece6738da9dd31ad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"ece6738da9dd31ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}$ is the countermodel predicate from\n[[89-df-gl-countermodel]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ref}_{G\\!L}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}refutation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ref}_{G\\!L}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\;\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}(M,A).","display":true}],"bytes":773,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-296","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-refutation]]"}],"outgoing":["ece6738da9dd31ad"]}